  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support 30-year-old human rights NGO in Russia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Civi Assistance Committee is a charitable human rights NGO that has been operating in Russia for over 33 years. But due to the intensification of repression against civil society in Russia, the work of the organization is under threat. This project will help pay for the rent of the premises, the salaries of employees, so that this NGO can continue what it has been doing all this time - to protect and help migrants and refugees in Russia.</narrative>
  </description>
